name: 🐛 Bug Report
description: Report a bug or unexpected behavior in PlumoAI
title: "[Bug]: "
labels: ["bug", "needs-triage"]
assignees: []

body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        ## 🐛 Thanks for taking the time to report a bug!

        Before opening this issue, please:
        - 🔍 **Search existing issues** to avoid duplicates
        - 🔒 **Do NOT report security vulnerabilities here** — use [SECURITY.md](https://github.com/PlumoAI/plumoai/blob/main/SECURITY.md) instead
        - 📧 For private beta access issues, contact **krishna@plumoai.com**

        Fill in as much detail as you can — it helps us fix things faster.

  - type: dropdown
    id: component
    attributes:
      label: 🧩 Which PlumoAI component is affected?
      description: Select the component where the bug occurs.
      multiple: false
      options:
        - AI Employee (core behavior / reasoning)
        - App AI Agent (MCP integration / tool connection)
        - Project Management Workspace (tasks / projects / assignments)
        - OpenClaw (workflow planning / execution)
        - Authorization & Permissions
        - Memory (persistence / context)
        - Presence (chat / email / audio interface)
        - Docker / Self-Hosted Deployment
        - PlumoAI Cloud
        - Documentation
        - Other
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: dropdown
    id: deployment
    attributes:
      label: 🚀 How are you running PlumoAI?
      options:
        - Self-hosted (Docker)
        - PlumoAI Cloud
        - Local development build
        - Other
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: description
    attributes:
      label: 📋 Bug Description
      description: A clear and concise description of what the bug is.
      placeholder: "When I do X, Y happens instead of Z..."
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: reproduce
    attributes:
      label: 🔁 Steps to Reproduce
      description: Exact steps to reproduce the behavior. The more specific, the better.
      placeholder: |
        1. Deploy PlumoAI using Docker
        2. Create an AI Employee with role '...'
        3. Connect App AI Agent for '...'
        4. Assign task '...'
        5. See error
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: expected
    attributes:
      label: ✅ Expected Behavior
      description: What did you expect to happen?
      placeholder: "The AI Employee should have..."
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: actual
    attributes:
      label: ❌ Actual Behavior
      description: What actually happened instead?
      placeholder: "Instead, the AI Employee..."
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: logs
    attributes:
      label: 📄 Error Logs / Console Output
      description: |
        Paste any relevant logs, stack traces, or error messages.
        For Docker deployments: `docker logs <container_name>`
      render: shell
      placeholder: |
        Paste logs here...

  - type: textarea
    id: environment
    attributes:
      label: 🖥️ Environment Details
      description: Tell us about your setup.
      value: |
        - PlumoAI version / Docker image tag:
        - OS: (e.g. Ubuntu 22.04, macOS 14, Windows 11)
        - Docker version:
        - Browser (if UI-related):
        - LLM provider connected (if applicable):
        - App AI Agents connected (if applicable):
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: ai_employee_config
    attributes:
      label: 🤖 AI Employee Configuration (if relevant)
      description: |
        If the bug involves a specific AI Employee setup, describe its configuration.
        Remove any sensitive information (API keys, credentials, etc.)
      placeholder: |
        - Role:
        - Tools / App AI Agents connected:
        - Authorization scope:
        - Memory settings:
        - Presence type:

  - type: textarea
    id: workaround
    attributes:
      label: 🔧 Workaround (if any)
      description: Have you found any temporary way to get around this bug?
      placeholder: "I was able to work around it by..."

  - type: dropdown
    id: severity
    attributes:
      label: 💥 Severity
      description: How much does this bug impact your usage?
      options:
        - Critical — platform unusable / data loss
        - High — core feature broken, no workaround
        - Medium — feature partially broken, workaround exists
        - Low — minor inconvenience
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: screenshots
    attributes:
      label: 📸 Screenshots or Screen Recording
      description: If applicable, add screenshots or a recording to help explain the issue.
      placeholder: "Drag and drop images here, or paste a link..."

  - type: checkboxes
    id: checklist
    attributes:
      label: ✅ Pre-submission Checklist
      options:
        - label: I have searched existing issues and this is not a duplicate
          required: true
        - label: I have included all relevant logs and environment details
          required: true
        - label: I have removed any sensitive information (API keys, credentials) from this report
          required: true
        - label: This is not a security vulnerability (those go to SECURITY.md)
          required: true

  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        ---
        💬 **Need faster help?** Join the conversation or reach out at **krishna@plumoai.com** for private beta access issues.
        🌍 **Want to fix this yourself?** Check our [Contributing Guide](https://github.com/PlumoAI/plumoai/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) — we welcome PRs!
